data: {"answer": "This location is the **Banquet Door**, which requires Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) to enter. You must provide two factors: a code from the corridor policy board and something you have. The systems shown here are Event Registration & Check-in, and it demonstrates threats like MFA Fatigue and controls such as MFA prompts.", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What does the Event Registration & Check-in do?", "en": "What does the Event Registration & Check-in do?", "zh": "活動報名報到系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "How do we prevent MFA fatigue (push bombing)?", "en": "How do we prevent MFA fatigue (push bombing)?", "zh": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.05, "answer_s": 9.05, "total_s": 9.11}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "door_38d0", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "door_38d0"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.8}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "door_38d0", "label": "Room", "en": "Banquet Hall Door (locked)", "zh": "宴會廳門口（上鎖）"}, {"key": "event_system", "label": "System", "en": "Event Registration & Check-in", "zh": "活動報名報到系統"}, {"key": "mfa_fatigue", "label": "Threat", "en": "MFA Fatigue (Push Bombing)", "zh": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊"}, {"key": "mfa", "label": "Control", "en": "Multi-Factor Authentication", "zh": "多因素驗證"}, {"key": "c_authentication", "label": "Concept", "en": "Authentication Factors", "zh": "驗證因素"}], "edges": [{"a": "event_system", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "door_38d0"}, {"a": "mfa_fatigue", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "door_38d0"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "door_38d0"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "mfa"}, {"a": "mfa", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "door_38d0"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Banquet Door · MFA Check (called 'Banquet Hall Door (locked)' in the tour)\nWhat it shows: The banquet hall door asks for two factors: something you know (the code from the corridor policy board) and something you have.\nKey lesson: A password alone is not enough for important systems.\nTo go on from here: the Banquet Hall door needs its code: two numbers from the Security Policy Board in the corridor (the passphrase length, then the screen-lock minutes).\nSystems here: Event Registration & Check-in\nThreats shown here: MFA Fatigue (Push Bombing)\nControls you can see: Multi-Factor Authentication\nConcepts: Authentication Factors\nProcedures to know: MFA prompts I did not start\nExits: Banquet Door · Failed Login (called 'Banquet Hall Door (wrong code)' in the tour), Security Awareness Training Room", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 9.05, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 622, "prompt_s": 2.1, "gen_tokens": 69, "gen_s": 5.96, "tok_per_s": 11.6, "first_token_s": 3.09}}, "state": {}}

